查询写好了：直接替换现有 `SQL_Plan PR` 的代码，表名和列名都不变，所以页面上的视觉对象、关系、计算列都不用重新绑。我这里跑不了 Power BI，只做了两件事：用微软的 Power Query 解析器查过语法，并把同样的逻辑在今天这份导出上跑了一遍（7,193 行，3,967 Plan + 3,226 PReq）。

**先更正上一条的第 6 点**：供应商代码没有变，是 S/4 版 ZMMRP 导出把 Vendor 列截成了 6 位。我拿 4,264 张两边都有的 PO 对过，ZMMRP 的 Vendor 全部是 datamart 里 7 位代码的前 6 位。查询里已按"前 6 位，重码时再比名称"还原成完整代码。

## 第 1 步：替换查询

Transform data > 选中 `SQL_Plan PR` > Advanced Editor > 全部替换成下面的代码。第一行 `FolderPath` 改成和 `Excel_ZMMRP S4` 里一样的文件夹，然后 Close & Apply。

```m
let
    // ===== 1. Folder that holds the ZMMRP exports: use the same folder as Excel_ZMMRP S4 (change this one line) =====
    FolderPath = "\\ap1nas101it0593.file.core.windows.net\sinfile\Data\Procurement\Buyer's Folder\Jiaqi\ZMMRP S4",

    // ===== 2. Take the newest .xlsx in that folder =====
    Files = Folder.Files(FolderPath),
    XlsxFiles = Table.SelectRows(Files, each Text.Lower([Extension]) = ".xlsx" and not Text.StartsWith([Name], "~$")),
    Latest = if Table.IsEmpty(XlsxFiles)
        then error "ZMMRP: no .xlsx file found in " & FolderPath
        else Table.First(Table.Sort(XlsxFiles, {{"Date modified", Order.Descending}})),
    Book = Excel.Workbook(Latest[Content], null, true),
    Raw = Table.SelectRows(Book, each [Kind] = "Sheet"){0}[Data],

    // ===== 3. Find the header row and the columns by name =====
    // The export pads every cell with spaces, puts the header on row 5 and cuts names to 10 characters.
    Clean = (v as any) as text => if v = null then "" else Text.Trim(Text.From(v)),
    AllRows = List.Buffer(Table.ToRows(Raw)),
    HeaderFlags = List.Transform(List.FirstN(AllRows, 50), (r) => let c = List.Transform(r, Clean) in List.Contains(c, "Order") and List.Contains(c, "MRP El")),
    HeaderIndex = if List.PositionOf(HeaderFlags, true) < 0
        then error "ZMMRP: header row with Order and MRP El not found"
        else List.PositionOf(HeaderFlags, true),
    Header = List.Transform(AllRows{HeaderIndex}, Clean),
    Col = (name as text) as number =>
        let
            exact = List.PositionOf(Header, name),
            i = if exact >= 0 then exact else List.PositionOf(List.Transform(Header, each Text.StartsWith(_, name)), true)
        in
            if i < 0 then error "ZMMRP: column not found: " & name else i,
    iPlant = Col("Plant"),
    iMat = Col("Material"),
    iOrder = Col("Order"),
    iItem = Col("Item"),
    iEl = Col("MRP El"),
    iMad = Col("MAD wo GR"),
    iRel = Col("Strt/Rel D"),
    iQty = Col("Supply Qty"),
    iVendor = Col("Vendor"),
    iName = Col("Name"),
    iStd = Col("STD Price"),
    iPpx = Col("Planned Pr"),
    iUnit = Col("Price Unit"),

    // ===== 4. Converters (independent of the PC's regional settings) =====
    ToDate = (v as any) as nullable date =>
        if v = null then null
        else if v is date then v
        else if v is datetime then Date.From(v)
        else
            let
                t = Text.Trim(Text.From(v)),
                sep = if Text.Contains(t, "/") then "/" else if Text.Contains(t, ".") then "." else "-",
                p = Text.Split(t, sep)
            in
                if List.Count(p) <> 3 then null
                else try (
                    if Text.Length(p{0}) = 4 then #date(Number.FromText(p{0}), Number.FromText(p{1}), Number.FromText(p{2}))
                    else if sep = "." then #date(Number.FromText(p{2}), Number.FromText(p{1}), Number.FromText(p{0}))
                    else #date(Number.FromText(p{2}), Number.FromText(p{0}), Number.FromText(p{1}))
                ) otherwise null,
    // Numbers arrive as text such as 1,434.00 (comma = thousands, dot = decimals).
    ToNum = (v as any) as nullable number =>
        if v = null then null
        else if v is number then v
        else
            let
                t = Text.Remove(Text.Trim(Text.From(v)), {",", " "}),
                neg = Text.EndsWith(t, "-"),
                n = try Number.FromText(Text.TrimEnd(t, "-"), "en-US") otherwise null
            in
                if n = null then null else if neg then -n else n,

    // ===== 5. Planning (P) rate SGD -> USD: this year's row of SQL_Planning Currency, else the latest earlier year =====
    RateRows = Table.SelectRows(#"SQL_Planning Currency", each Text.StartsWith([#"CRNCY-Year"], "SGD-")),
    RateYears = Table.AddColumn(RateRows, "RateYear", each Number.FromText(Text.AfterDelimiter([#"CRNCY-Year"], "-")), Int64.Type),
    UsableRates = Table.SelectRows(RateYears, each [RateYear] <= Date.Year(DateTime.LocalNow())),
    PRate = if Table.IsEmpty(UsableRates)
        then error "ZMMRP: no SGD planning rate found in SQL_Planning Currency"
        else Table.Max(UsableRates, "RateYear")[UKURS_EXCHANGE_RATE],

    // ===== 6. Keep planned orders (Plan) and purchase requisitions (PReq) =====
    DataRows = List.Skip(AllRows, HeaderIndex + 1),
    PlanPR = List.Buffer(List.Select(DataRows, (r) =>
        let el = Text.Lower(Clean(r{iEl}))
        in (el = "plan" or el = "preq") and Clean(r{iOrder}) <> "")),

    // ===== 7. Vendor code: the export cuts the 7-digit vendor number to 6 characters =====
    // Rebuild the full code from Excel_Buyer-Vendor Allocation: same first 6 digits, and the same name when several codes share them.
    // A vendor that cannot be matched keeps the code as exported.
    NameKey = (v as any) as text => Text.Start(Text.Select(Text.Upper(Clean(v)), {"A".."Z", "0".."9"}), 6),
    Alloc = List.Buffer(List.Transform(
        Table.ToRecords(Table.SelectColumns(#"Excel_Buyer-Vendor Allocation", {"Vendor Code", "Vendor Name"})),
        (a) => [Code = Clean(a[Vendor Code]), Key = NameKey(a[Vendor Name])])),
    MapVendor = (code as text, name as text) as nullable text =>
        if code = "" then null
        else
            let
                cands = List.Select(Alloc, (a) => a[Code] = code or (Text.Length(code) = 6 and Text.Length(a[Code]) = 7 and Text.StartsWith(a[Code], code))),
                byName = List.Select(cands, (a) => a[Key] = NameKey(name))
            in
                if List.Count(cands) = 1 then cands{0}[Code]
                else if List.Count(byName) = 1 then byName{0}[Code]
                else code,
    Pairs = List.Buffer(List.Distinct(List.Transform(PlanPR, (r) => Clean(r{iVendor}) & "|" & Clean(r{iName})))),
    VendorMap = Record.FromList(
        List.Transform(Pairs, (k) => MapVendor(Text.BeforeDelimiter(k, "|"), Text.AfterDelimiter(k, "|"))),
        Pairs),

    // ===== 8. Same column names as the old SQL_Plan PR, so visuals, relationships and calculated columns keep working =====
    Records = List.Transform(PlanPR, (r) =>
        let
            isPlan = Text.Lower(Clean(r{iEl})) = "plan",
            ord = Text.TrimStart(Clean(r{iOrder}), "0"),
            itm = Text.TrimStart(Clean(r{iItem}), "0"),
            qty = ToNum(r{iQty}),
            unit = ToNum(r{iUnit}),
            std = ToNum(r{iStd}),
            mad = ToDate(r{iMad}),
            rel = ToDate(r{iRel}),
            vName = Clean(r{iName})
        in
            [
                PLANT = Clean(r{iPlant}),
                MTRL_NBR = Text.TrimStart(Clean(r{iMat}), "0"),
                MRP_ELEM_CD = if isPlan then "PA" else "BA",
                ISU_STRG_LOCN = null,                                   // not in the export
                MRP_ELEM_NBR = ord,
                MRP_ELEM_ITM_NBR = itm,
                DLVRY_DT = if mad = null then null else DateTime.From(mad),   // MAD wo GR
                REQ_DT = null,                                          // not in the export
                RLS_DT = if rel = null then null else DateTime.From(rel),     // Strt/Rel D
                SCHED_NBR = null,                                       // not in the export
                REQ_QTY = qty,                                          // Supply Qty
                SCRAP_QTY = 0,
                VNDR_NBR = Record.Field(VendorMap, Clean(r{iVendor}) & "|" & vName),
                VNDR_NM = if vName = "" then null else vName,
                // STD Price in USD at the P rate (same basis as the old ML30 column)
                #"USD Price ML30" = if qty = null or std = null or unit = null or unit = 0 then null else std / unit * qty * PRate,
                // Planned Pr = planned price 2, or planned price 1 when price 2 is empty
                FUT_PLN_PRC2 = ToNum(r{iPpx}),
                #"SQL_PPX.COST_LOT_SZ" = unit,                          // Price Unit
                PR_Item = ord & "_" & itm,
                #"P Rate" = PRate,
                #"Export File" = Latest[Name]
            ]),
    Result = Table.FromRecords(Records, type table [
        PLANT = text, MTRL_NBR = text, MRP_ELEM_CD = text, ISU_STRG_LOCN = nullable text,
        MRP_ELEM_NBR = text, MRP_ELEM_ITM_NBR = text,
        DLVRY_DT = nullable datetime, REQ_DT = nullable datetime, RLS_DT = nullable datetime,
        SCHED_NBR = nullable text, REQ_QTY = nullable number, SCRAP_QTY = nullable number,
        VNDR_NBR = nullable text, VNDR_NM = nullable text,
        #"USD Price ML30" = nullable number, FUT_PLN_PRC2 = nullable number, #"SQL_PPX.COST_LOT_SZ" = nullable number,
        PR_Item = text, #"P Rate" = number, #"Export File" = text]),
    Deduped = Table.Distinct(Result, {"PR_Item"})
in
    Deduped
```

这个查询和文件里现有的 `SQL_Open PR` 是同一种写法（既直接读数据源又引用别的查询），正常不会报 Formula.Firewall。

## 第 2 步：汇率（改一行 DAX）

在 `#PPX per PO` 计算列里，把 `VAR FXRate = 1.2941` 改成：

```dax
VAR FXRate = DIVIDE ( 1, 'SQL_Plan PR'[P Rate] )
```

`P Rate` 取 `SQL_Planning Currency` 里当年那一行（2026 是 0.78451）。明年在那个查询里加一行 2027，这里会自动跟着换。

## 第 3 步：页面筛选器

Plan & PR 和 PR Need Source 两页都有同一个 MTRL_NBR 高级筛选，把 Or 改成 And。

